<section class="container kube-reading mx-auto px-5 py-16"><p class="kube-label">About KubeDaily</p><h1>Making cloud-native knowledge more accessible</h1><p class="kube-dek">KubeDaily is dedicated to demystifying the container and orchestration ecosystem through high-quality resources and educational content.</p><p>We collaborate with cloud-native experts, industry partners, and community contributors to make Kubernetes, containers, and operational practices easier to learn and apply.</p><p>Every original KubeDaily lab, article, data set, tool entry, and media file is preserved in this Phoenix implementation.</p></section>
